# API (Vercel)

- Serverless handlers only; no long-lived processes.
- Secrets from `process.env` — never commit tokens.
- Client uses `VITE_*`; server may use `FIREBASE_*`, `MP_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`.
- Reuse CORS pattern from `api/create-preference.ts` (`setCors` + OPTIONS).
- Return JSON errors with appropriate HTTP status.
